<p>But sometimes when you <code>useEffect</code>, the pieces don=E2=80=99t =
quite fit together. You have a nagging feeling that you=E2=80=99re missing =
something. It seems similar to class lifecycles=E2=80=A6 but is it really? =
You find yourself asking questions like:</p>
<ul>
<li>=F0=9F=A4=94 How do I replicate <code>componentDidMount</code> with <co=
de>useEffect</code>?</li>
