_counter.gif" alt=3D"Screen recording of 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 logged in order"></p=
>
<p>You may think: =E2=80=9COf course that=E2=80=99s how it works! How else =
could it work?=E2=80=9D</p>
<p>Well, that=E2=80=99s not how <code>this.state</code> works in classes. I=
t=E2=80=99s easy to make the mistake of thinking that this <a target=3D"_bl=
