r"></p>
<p>I think it=E2=80=99s ironic that Hooks rely so much on JavaScript closur=
es, and yet it=E2=80=99s the class implementation that suffers from <a targ=
et=3D"_blank" class=3D" scale-100 active:scale-100" style=3D"opacity:1;tran=
