<p>I like to think of these cases as =E2=80=9Cfalse dependencies=E2=80=9D. =
Yes, <code>count</code> was a necessary dependency because we wrote <code>s=
etCount(count + 1)</code> inside the effect. However, we only truly needed =
<code>count</code> to transform it into <code>count + 1</code> and =E2=80=
